# Build output under the pre-`cli/` visualiser location. `cli/target/` and the
# root-anchored `/dist/` above do not reach it, so a build here snapshots tens of
# thousands of paths into the working copy. Only `SKILL.md` under this tree is
# tracked; nothing generated is, including the `bin/*.debug.tar.gz` archives.
skills/visualisation/visualise/frontend/dist/
skills/visualisation/visualise/server/target/
workspaces/
node_modules/
mise.local.toml

# Everything bin/accelerator and the launcher write into the directory the
# plugin ships from: the cached launcher and its signature, the staged verify
# shims, the lock, the unverified-launcher record, and the sub-binary cache.
# The staged-shim pattern is digest-anchored on purpose — `-*-*` would also
# match the four committed vendored shims, silently blocking `git add` after a
# `build:vendor-verify-shims` refresh while lint:vendor-shims:check stayed
# green on the unchanged marker.
bin/accelerator-launcher-*
bin/accelerator-verify-*-[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]*
bin/visualiser-*
bin/vcs-*
bin/work-*
bin/corpus-*
bin/collaboration-*
bin/migrate-*
bin/design-*
bin/*.minisig
bin/.accelerator-lock-*
bin/.accelerator-unverified.log
bin/.tmp-*

# Release-only symbolication archives: `build:debug-archives` writes them into
# the committed skill tree so the provenance glob covers them, and the release
# job attaches them to the GitHub release. They are never in manifest.json and
# never fetched by the launcher, so nothing in the plugin package needs them.
# The `**/` is load-bearing: a mid-string separator anchors a pattern to this
# file's own directory, so the bare `bin/` form matched only `<root>/bin/` and
# never the skill tree the archives are actually written into.
**/bin/*.debug.tar.gz

# Dev-launcher override marker: untracked and unshippable by design, so no clone
# or marketplace install can carry it (bin/accelerator gates on its presence).
/.accelerator-dev-launcher

# The measurement harness's artefact manifest — the interlock token a dead run
# leaves behind for `mise run measure:teardown` to replay. Deliberately not
# under bin/, which is the launcher's live cache root whose entry set the
# harness itself uses as an integrity witness.
/.accelerator-measure/

# minisign secret keys must never be committed — the release secret lives in
# the GitHub release environment; only public keys are tracked.
*.key
/keys/*.sec

# `create --push`/`update --push`'s pending-push markers: per-checkout,
# transient local state. Without this, jj's auto-snapshot commits a marker
# the moment it is written, wedging every collaborator's checkout on a
# title only one of them was pushing.
.accelerator/state/integrations/*/pending-push/
